Alembic migration environment for the Workstream backend.

The active graph begins at the single 0001_uuid7_v01 root. Databases stamped
with a removed development revision must be recreated; they are never stamped
or upgraded across the v0.1 clean cut. The baseline uses native UUID storage
and UUIDv7 for generated record identities. New revisions begin at 0002.
Offline SQL generation is intentionally disabled because the clean-database
preflight requires a live PostgreSQL target.
